WEBVTT

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:10.530
We weren't able to make Mikono
Suzushiro manifest an Element power.

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:11.980
I see.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:15.900
We'll be sending her home, as expected.

00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:17.440
I see.

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:21.980
I think beef bowls are better with
raw ginger rather than pickled ginger.

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:23.580
I see.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:28.840
About the Aquarion disaster...

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:32.900
Welcome back to Earth.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:34.550
I did some investigating.

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:40.170
The forbidden Aquarion was last sent out nine years ago.

00:00:40.170 --> 00:00:42.560
The head pilot was Donar Dantes.

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:47.460
What is Aquarion?

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:49.480
And what was the disaster you were—

00:00:50.970 --> 00:00:56.490
I can't say it any better than this.

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:01.220
That mock battle yesterday was incredible!

00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:02.800
I know, right? Wow!

00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:10.840
I'm never going to see Amata again.

00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:16.100
He's one of Aquarion's Elements now.

00:01:16.690 --> 00:01:19.020
Just like Cayenne.

00:01:19.890 --> 00:01:22.240
I'm not part of their world anymore.

00:01:24.110 --> 00:01:25.480
Really?

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:27.340
You're just gonna go?

00:01:27.340 --> 00:01:28.860
And leave your boyfriend?

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:29.840
Boyfriend?

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:32.360
I think his name was Amata.

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:35.520
You know, the one you were in Aquarion with?

00:01:36.050 --> 00:01:37.110
That...

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:39.540
Haven't you forgiven him yet?

00:01:39.540 --> 00:01:42.030
He even bowed in the mock battle.

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:44.290
I'm pretty sure he was saying sorry to you.

00:01:45.470 --> 00:01:47.340
That's none of your business.

00:01:49.310 --> 00:01:50.540
That's just how it is with you, isn't it?

00:01:51.650 --> 00:01:54.420
"Oh, I'm so useless." "Boo, it's none of your business."

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:55.900
You're so negative all the time.

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:58.020
Whatever.

00:01:58.990 --> 00:02:01.220
C'mon. Let's shake hands before you leave.

00:02:05.730 --> 00:02:07.100
Good-bye.

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:56.400
I hope Mikono understood why I was bowing.

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:57.800
No!

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:02.080
My hole! My path to hope!

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:03.050
Andy?

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:06.240
Impossible!

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:09.140
This material has absolutely no weak points!

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:10.930
Is that the hole from yesterday?

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:11.980
Did someone fill it?

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:14.020
They didn't just fill it!

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:15.960
They filled it with an Element power!

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:20.260
Whoever filled this hole is on the other side of that wall.

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:22.060
It's one of the girls!

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:23.020
A girl?

00:04:23.020 --> 00:04:24.370
I can feel it...

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:27.030
An impenetrably hard heart of stone!

00:04:27.370 --> 00:04:29.080
But I can feel something else...

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:34.040
The cutie who filled this hole is waiting for someone to dig in and reach her!

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:38.590
Just you wait, gorgeous! I'm on my way!

00:04:38.590 --> 00:04:42.540
You're not even considering that a boy could've done it.

00:04:49.210 --> 00:04:50.280
Hey, that song...

00:04:51.550 --> 00:04:54.310
Oh, that's Shrade.

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:55.350
Who's Shrade?

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:58.620
He's the top student here at Holy Angel Academy.

00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:00.780
He's got some kind of Element scholarship.

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:04.610
He gets to sit out of training, and he's never been deployed.

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:10.960
But word on the street is that girls are buying up way more of his pics than any other guy's.

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:14.580
Hey, where are you going?

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:17.120
Sorry about that.

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:19.460
Dude, wait up!

00:05:37.150 --> 00:05:38.020
Come in.

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:41.440
Hey, Shrade. Sorry if we're interrupting something.

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:42.730
Don't worry about it, Andy.

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:56.910
The simulator played a lovely tone in yesterday's mock battle.

00:05:57.690 --> 00:05:59.420
That was you, wasn't it?

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:02.780
How can you even tell?

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:07.300
It was a unique tone. Very honest.

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:11.550
Even silence can carry emotion.

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:15.310
It can change the course of a heart.

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:18.810
Hello. My name is Amata Sora.

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:21.370
I'm Shrade Elan.

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:23.120
There you are!

00:06:24.990 --> 00:06:26.360
Cayenne!

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:28.750
How unlike you, my friend.

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:29.780
What brings you here?

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:32.620
Shut it! I'm not here for you!

00:06:33.690 --> 00:06:36.580
You! What the hell was that in the mock battle?

00:06:37.030 --> 00:06:39.540
I think you're asking for a beating!

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:40.210
Cayenne!

00:06:41.450 --> 00:06:42.280
What're you doing?!

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:45.020
Please don't fight here.

00:06:45.020 --> 00:06:47.340
I do dislike having to bring you down.

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:48.460
Quit struggling!

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:53.800
I told you!

00:07:01.060 --> 00:07:04.070
S-Shrade! You...

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:16.330
Farewell, Amata.

00:07:17.150 --> 00:07:19.480
And farewell, Cayenne.

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:22.300
Farewell.

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:30.060
Mikono!

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:35.140
Are you all right?

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:39.730
How does Shrade look so calm while he's doing that?

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:43.360
That's Shrade's Element power.

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:47.230
He uses sound to manipulate peoples' emotions.

00:07:48.550 --> 00:07:51.280
Your mind is in chaos.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:52.860
You said "Mikono", didn't you?

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:56.240
Have you been worried about your sister?

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:03.960
And so angry.

00:08:03.960 --> 00:08:06.210
You started it!

00:08:07.310 --> 00:08:08.800
I suppose.

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:14.220
A dissonant strain is near.

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:24.280
Neo-Kowloon?

00:08:24.280 --> 00:08:26.520
That's right next to the Academy!

00:08:29.030 --> 00:08:29.860
Sweet!

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:30.570
What?

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:32.080
Me?

00:08:32.080 --> 00:08:33.540
That's us!

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:35.200
Let's go!

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:36.980
But why me?

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:53.340
Vector X launching!

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:57.050
Vector Y launching!

00:08:58.260 --> 00:09:00.890
Vector Z launching!

00:09:08.590 --> 00:09:10.500
This isn't just practice.

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:12.030
These are real enemies!

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:14.340
I can't believe this.

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:16.820
You're going to send me into battle with this newbie again?

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:19.420
Aquarion's power is coming online.

00:09:19.930 --> 00:09:21.080
It looks like

00:09:21.630 --> 00:09:24.520
he has the ability to draw it out.

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:28.290
We're going to face stronger enemies from here on out.

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:33.920
If there is anything we can do to
ensure our victory, we <i>must</i> seize it.

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:39.530
The humanoid isn't there.

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:41.500
Guess it's just the cannon fodder.

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:42.640
Let's finish this!

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:44.640
Go! Aquarion!

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:03.840
Aquarion Gepard!

00:10:15.610 --> 00:10:17.890
Aquarion is fighting.

00:10:17.890 --> 00:10:21.240
Cayenne... Amata might be inside, too...

00:10:24.610 --> 00:10:29.140
My chest feels... I have a bad feeling about this...

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:41.740
We're surrounded!

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.060
They're really strong!

00:10:58.060 --> 00:10:59.880
They're unmanned, aren't they?

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:02.520
They're acting like they're organized!

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:04.140
They've never done that before!

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:06.890
There must be a commander somewhere.

00:11:12.570 --> 00:11:15.380
Showtime in the shadows.

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:28.620
They're not going to make it!

00:11:28.930 --> 00:11:31.220
Commander! Element Change!

00:11:31.220 --> 00:11:33.670
We have to send out Shrade! He's our ace in the hole!

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:35.630
But his body can't...

00:11:51.480 --> 00:11:52.460
Where is he?

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:55.780
Where's the boss?

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:02.860
I'll awaken your power, my friend.

00:12:26.710 --> 00:12:27.970
We're caught!

00:12:28.710 --> 00:12:30.320
I can't move!

00:12:34.390 --> 00:12:35.020
What?

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:37.230
Piano music!

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:42.780
Shrade, what are you doing?

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:47.740
I'm getting a vision...

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:05.050
There you are!

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:15.100
Aw, man. They found me.

00:13:15.670 --> 00:13:18.200
But it's too late!

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:24.300
The enemy was on the Three Fortunes!

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:27.950
Blast! He can evade all of our attacks!

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:35.900
They're gonna lose!

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:37.500
We can't land now!

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:38.520
Cayenne...

00:13:38.520 --> 00:13:40.200
Sorry about this!

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:44.380
So sorry!

00:13:45.820 --> 00:13:47.550
The boat's turning around!

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:52.470
Sorry... for taking the wheel of destiny!

00:13:56.940 --> 00:13:58.040
Goddamn it!

00:13:58.040 --> 00:14:01.940
I'm gonna die without even getting to Unite with a girl!

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:04.300
Andy's spirit level is falling!

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:06.570
The Union is going to collapse!

00:14:07.090 --> 00:14:09.320
Principal! I mean Commander!

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:10.450
Someone has to Element Change!

00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:11.740
I'll do it!

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:13.220
Switch everybody out!

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:14.870
The girls can handle this!

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:16.220
Hey!

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:17.620
Commander, give us your orders!

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:20.800
Commander! Send us out!

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:21.940
Principal!

00:14:21.940 --> 00:14:23.630
Commander!

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:25.380
Element Change!

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:31.850
Call back Andy W. Hol!

00:14:32.310 --> 00:14:34.850
Change him out for Mikono Suzushiro!

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:36.400
What?

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:37.730
Who are you?

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:40.650
B-But I...

00:14:40.650 --> 00:14:42.060
Get out!

00:14:42.060 --> 00:14:44.780
We don't take orders from outsiders!

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:54.260
W-Who is this clown?

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:02.710
C-Could you be?

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:04.980
Fudo Zen!

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:06.050
Fudo?

00:15:07.770 --> 00:15:10.840
We have awaited your arrival, High Commander Fudo.

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:13.350
High Commander?

00:15:13.970 --> 00:15:17.270
Mikono Suzushiro, you will be one of Aquarion's pilots.

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:20.260
I can't! I'm useless!

00:15:20.830 --> 00:15:22.580
I'm not even an Element!

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:25.020
Look over there.

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:32.840
Those boys are fools.

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:36.580
They only know of one way to protect what they love.

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:40.500
They only know how to be hurt.

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:42.710
You shut up!

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:44.960
Get away from him, Mikono!

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:48.020
Mikono! Get up and let's go!

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:51.900
They've been protecting me.

00:15:52.970 --> 00:15:55.970
Cayenne and Amata let themselves get hurt for me.

00:15:56.330 --> 00:15:58.160
I'd rather my body get hurt...

00:15:58.750 --> 00:16:00.180
than my heart...

00:16:00.970 --> 00:16:05.560
They're still protecting me right now...

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:10.240
Mikono!

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:15.410
I can't... That's it for me...

00:16:18.810 --> 00:16:20.410
The Union has collapsed!

00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:25.900
I'll do it!

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:26.920
Really?

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:29.420
But aren't you useless?

00:16:30.870 --> 00:16:34.180
I'm completely useless. I know.

00:16:34.690 --> 00:16:36.430
But I...

00:16:37.610 --> 00:16:41.060
I want to hold their hands one more time!

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:44.460
Then go!

00:16:50.170 --> 00:16:52.150
Element Change!

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:02.910
Mikono?

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:05.420
Mikono! What are you doing here?

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:07.240
Amata! Let's Unite!

00:17:07.240 --> 00:17:07.750
But—

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:10.710
I forgive you! Just do it!

00:17:11.310 --> 00:17:12.360
Really?

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:13.720
Great!

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:16.220
Now shout, Amata Sora!

00:17:16.630 --> 00:17:18.130
Snow Melting Union!

00:17:18.130 --> 00:17:21.060
Go! Aquarion!

00:17:27.990 --> 00:17:30.360
Aquarion Evol!

00:17:39.530 --> 00:17:42.740
That's the form they used to fight Kagura.

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:44.290
Too bad we already know what it can do.

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:53.760
Mikono! Why are you in Aquarion?

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:58.790
I never wanted you on the battlefield!

00:17:58.790 --> 00:18:00.010
Cayenne!

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:06.680
I've been having the same Prophecy of Despair ever since we were children.

00:18:07.490 --> 00:18:10.610
Mikono, you approach Aquarion, and...

00:18:11.930 --> 00:18:13.400
If only I'd never had that vision.

00:18:16.570 --> 00:18:19.910
Mikono, I wanted to protect you.

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:22.060
I don't care if you hate me.

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:24.040
I'll protect you!

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:31.750
You've always protected me.

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:34.460
Thank you.

00:18:35.150 --> 00:18:38.780
But I don't want to sit around and let you protect me any more.

00:18:39.590 --> 00:18:41.220
You're my brother.

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:43.810
I want to protect you, too.

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:48.060
I want to get hurt, too.

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:49.240
Mikono!

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:54.820
You too, Amata.

00:18:56.410 --> 00:18:59.530
Don't hurt yourself for me anymore.

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:01.380
All right...

00:19:02.150 --> 00:19:07.540
When Mikono's with me... I feel like...

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:10.040
I can do anything!

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:16.880
The resonance between the Elements in Aquarion is strengthening!

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:17.720
What?

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:18.630
What does this mean?

00:19:36.770 --> 00:19:38.280
What is this?

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:40.240
Aquarion's heart is beating.

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:46.340
I'll tell you what's in Aquarion's chest.

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:49.040
It's the pulse of youth.

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:56.250
I feel... like I'm flying...

00:19:56.710 --> 00:19:58.160
My heart is pounding.

00:19:58.690 --> 00:20:02.760
We join hands, we join hearts, and it only pounds harder...

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:06.730
Our feelings will reach the sky.

00:20:06.730 --> 00:20:08.350
And to infinity!

00:21:28.570 --> 00:21:31.640
How far does that fist go?

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:34.560
Wait! It's coming back towards the Neo-Deava base!

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:36.620
What?!

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:47.820
The Berlin!

00:21:52.690 --> 00:21:54.200
Whoa, girls!

00:21:54.810 --> 00:21:56.460
Oh, no! Boys!

00:21:58.960 --> 00:21:59.710
Silence!

00:22:01.730 --> 00:22:04.930
The barrier between men and women is shattered!

00:22:04.930 --> 00:22:07.510
But I hereby declare...

00:22:11.140 --> 00:22:14.020
Love is forbidden!

00:22:14.020 --> 00:22:16.680
What?!

00:22:35.270 --> 00:22:38.240
Good morning, Kagura.

00:24:11.450 --> 00:24:14.930
Love blossoms by the poolside.

00:24:14.930 --> 00:24:18.080
You come running to me, cocktail in hand.

00:24:18.600 --> 00:24:20.480
It's romance beneath the summer sky!

00:24:20.480 --> 00:24:24.300
Next time on Aquarion Evol: The Order Against Love.
